// An array as a value, chart instances and references: ref bind whole. KIELER rejects it: assignment to ‘int’ from
// ‘int *’ makes integer from pointer without a cast [-Wint-conversion].
scchart Main { int a[2] = {4,7} int c[2] output int x initial state A is Sub(a, c, x) } scchart Sub { input int p[2] input int q[2] output int o initial state A do o = p go to A }
